 after a while?", "y": 0.21957708283772814, "w": 0.1425938585069445, "h": 0.01822918733534831, "x": 0.5503755446471926}, {"w": 0.1848001437717014, "h": 0.013985691810773153, "text": "do. We've got exams soon, 3", "x": 0.5507655012295426, "y": 0.23636483909285602}, {"y": 0.20722489405810116, "text": "it was", "x": 0.8711312276432575, "w": 0.04127958509657115, "h": 0.009169397827520282}, {"text": "there was nothing to", "x": 0.7871198573217051, "y": 0.22129360494948536, "w": 0.1395348782009549, "h": 0.011517766972311145}, {"x": 0.8315748360080134, "text": "I'm working", "y": 0.23692545951660915, "w": 0.07923896789550788, "h": 0.010640151965488983}, {"x": 0.5491949879873156, "text": "hard. What else? I'm doing a lot of sport *_", "h": 0.013909883895075253, "w": 0.2826475863986545, "y": 0.25164244184715717}, {"text": "I'm also going out with a girl from my class. Her name's", "x": 0.5509839132739901, "y": 0.26808139547855514, "w": 0.3631484646267361, "h": 0.011449290415009824}, {"text": "Elaine. She lives near me, 5.", "h": 0.0127503461269696, "x": 0.5509839040741592, "y": 0.28188628142394945, "w": 0.17889087253146696}, {"w": 0.09481216430664063, "x": 0.8246869422876456, "h": 0.010221276464014675, "text": "I see her a lot.", "y": 0.28188628146654615}, {"x": 0.5471554248864277, "y": 0.29515913057207455, "text": "My parents are a bit worried•", "h": 0.01650839796995858, "w": 0.20093829684787334}, {"x": 0.8407871201595298, "y": 0.29716569786209435, "w": 0.07334526062011726, "h": 0.011417334738190914, "text": "I'm always"}, {"y": 0.31234011638222053, "w": 0.04472271813286677, "h": 0.01264534831477405, "x": 0.5491949918951051, "text": "tired?"}, {"h": 0.01146755085525103, "text": "I'm happy@", "x": 0.688729874658288, "y": 0.3136046514505754, "w": 0.07513416714138454}, {"x": 0.5527728150654322, "y": 0.3274277979366403, "text": "How about you? What are you up to? I know you are on", "w": 0.35778174506293403, "h": 0.012732085312316574}, {"x": 0.5508011638688659, "w": 0.0739427100287543, "y": 0.3436161962867705, "h": 0.010276848916973044, "text": "Facebook ®"}, {"w": 0.19677995469835063, "x": 0.7191413252745577, "h": 0.0114355948040202, "y": 0.34268895378669456, "text": "I don't often go on there now"}, {"h": 0.011572548293034566, "y": 0.3578633723755391, "text": "I haven't got time. I spend all my time", "w": 0.2504472181532118, "x": 0.6547406096174907}, {"text": "doing school work, playing football 1°", "y": 0.3715134263591745, "w": 0.25106531778971364, "h": 0.017062750654530386, "x": 0.5489490840507906}, {"h": 0.010116278651819317, "y": 0.37303779086449723, "w": 0.046511624654134054, "x": 0.8890876589311322, "text": "going"}, {"y": 0.38821220934774114, "w": 0.17352413601345484, "text": "to the cinema with Elaine.", "h": 0.01145385561867313, "x": 0.5509839089461647}, {"w": 0.07692307366265194, "y": 0.40830324891622843, "x": 0.5509839024128601, "text": "Write soon.", "h": 0.009029783393501837}, {"x": 0.5491949907104674, "w": 0.02862254036797407, "h": 0.010116278651819414, "y": 0.42235465142234613, "text": "Rob"}, {"text": "SHOW WHAT YOU'VE LEARNT", "y": 0.4652301445798134, "x": 0.5438282625974137, "w": 0.24329159206814233, "h": 0.012955776173285189}, {"y": 0.4931046931202727, "w": 0.40071556939019093, "h": 0.011444725211346617, "text": "5 You are on holiday. Write an email to a friend at home.", "x": 0.5366726307610763}, {"x": 0.554561721605465, "w": 0.17889087253146707, "text": "• Ask how your friend is.", "h": 0.011481246091828929, "y": 0.5107716606340128}, {"y": 0.5247819769632525, "h": 0.012686434773331489, "w": 0.24329159206814233, "text": "• Give two pieces of recent news.", "x": 0.5545617214376043}, {"h": 0.011426464771105413, "y": 0.5386462092701432, "x": 0.5545617236069766, "w": 0.22540249294704862, "text": "• Ask about your friend's news."}, {"y": 0.5526017444156507, "h": 0.012741215719643087, "text": "• Ask your friend to write back.", "x": 0.5545617259325579, "w": 0.22540249294704862}, {"x": 0.5402504533380735, "text": "SHOW T